					"documentation" : "@notice Have a pregnant Zodiac give birth!\r\n @param _matronId A Zodiac ready to give birth.\r\n @return The Zodiac ID of the new zodiac.\r\n @dev Looks at a given Zodiac and, if pregnant and if the gestation period has passed,\r\n  combines the genes of the two parents to create a new zodiac. The new Zodiac is assigned\r\n  to the current owner of the matron. Upon successful completion, both the matron and the\r\n  new zodiac will be ready to breed again. Note that anyone can call this function (if they\r\n  are willing to pay the gas!), but the new zodiac always goes to the mother's owner.\r",
					"id" : 2078,
					"implemented" : true,
					"isConstructor" : false,
					"isDeclaredConst" : false,
					"modifiers" : 
					[
						{
